| round4 | 3 | **Error as first line** + patrol results + recommendations | `interrupted` | ReplyPayload #2 — **ERROR_PREFIX_RE hit** |
| round5 | ≥4 | "All checks completed." | `stop` | ReplyPayload #3 |

